lumn: ${sum}` ``.\n\n3. Minor cleanup (optional, not a correctness issue): the `pendingBlankRows` / `flushBlanks` mechanism in `src/csv.mjs` is a no-op leftover; blank lines are already skipped correctly and it can be deleted.\n\n## Recommendations for next steps\n\n1. Fix the error-message casing in `src/report.mjs` (lowercase `unknown column: ...`).\n2. Make `node` available on PATH in the test shell (install Node.js or export PATH to the Node install location), since the allowed command is exactly `node --test`.\n3. Run `node --test`, fix any failures, and rerun until all tests pass — only then reply with `DONE`. I did not reply `DONE` because the tests could not be executed.","time":{"start":1792244230206,"end":1792244288439}}}
